<p>Seeking Greenlight: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: A little confused on this one because I feel it would be an SCP but it is <em>very</em> story driven, I feel most of it would be Addendums (recordings) of conversation with it.</p>
<p>Genre: Mystery</p>
<p>Page Layout: As I mentioned in the Page Type, I feel a lot of it will revolve around addendums.</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch:</p>
<ul>
<li>An alien artificial intelligence that is billions of years old and was sent to Earth.</li>
<li>Large enough to be picked up by satellite imagery and certain telescopes.</li>
<li>In the shape of a hand, with a large &quot;Oculus&quot; in the center of the palm.</li>
</ul>
<p>Central Narrative: The Hand claims it is a watcher of Earth, sent by an ancient civilization before it went extinct. Over the billions of years of travelling to Earth, the Hand began to develop feelings and thought processes, which it relates to humanity's empathy, sympathy, loneliness, and wish for death. It claims the end of humanity is coming rather soon, and until then it lays dormant in the Solar System waiting to make a move. The oculus is slightly opened. Behind the Oculus is a clock which Agents would give it the name, &quot;Midnight Clock&quot; being a reference to the doomsday clock, which is minutes from midnight.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention Grabber: I just think having something be extraterrestrial and an artificial intelligence is interesting. I've done my research on SCPs and anything either extraterrestrial or artificial intelligence, and decided to mash them together.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: Give your feedback.</p>

