<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Comedy</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A futuristic device discovered in an ancient ruin reveals a time-traveler's humorous grievances.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Object consists of a device discovered in ancient Sumerian ruins, believed to be the former abode of ████████. This device is a small square object which, when touched, unfolds into a pane of unnaturally tough glass about the size of a piece of paper. The pane displays a text on its surface in cuneiform, while also presenting the option to translate the text into thousands of languages including multiple extinct and anomalous ones. In English, the text complains that the recipient had sold low-quality copper to the author, who needed durable copper to repair their time machine and return to their home year of █████ ███. The author demands compensation and higher-quality copper.</p>
