<blockquote>
<p>Could I possibly create a MTF and create a dossier detailing what they do/would do</p>
</blockquote>
<p>MTFs typically don't have their own dossier pages. Do you have an example of the kind of page you would make for a dossier?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Then write tales + mission reports on encounters my MTF has with SCP's as well as backstories on important figures within the MTF?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You should write tales/after action reports first, since a dossier would be just a laundry list information dump without the background stories existing. Keep in mind that your material needs to entertain the audience with a story, rather than a list of facts about a group they haven't committed their interest to yet.</p>

